        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if there are any problems with the shipment, communicate them accordingly."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard captures the negative condition; action captures the communication step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After checking the shipment status again, if it is okay"
      ],
      "justification": "Branch and guard model the repeated check; action redundantly covers the positive path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, communicate any shipment problems."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard and action capture the alternative negative outcome."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n14",
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, once the payment is sent, the process comes to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Multiple actions and end nodes represent the termination point. Redundancy does not alter behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "In case there were any shipment problems, make sure to communicate them before proceeding to Ship Material."
      ],
      "justification": "Action captures the feedback loop step; converge handles structural rejoining."
